statement:
다음 프로그램의 출력 결과는 무엇인가?

## Python3 코드
```python
str1 = "abcde"
str2 = ['a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 'e', 'f', 'g']
len1 = len(str1) - 2
len2 = len(str2) - 3
print(str1[len2], str2[len1])
```

## C 코드

```c
char str1[] = "abcde"; 
char str2[] = {'a','b','c','d','e','f','g'};
int len1 = strlen(str1)-2;
int len2 = strlen(str2)-3;

printf("%c %c\n",str1[len2],str2[len1]);
```

## C++ 코드

```cpp
string str1 = "abcde"; 
char str2[] = {'a','b','c','d','e','f','g'};
int len1 = str1.length()-2;
int len2 = strlen(str2)-3;

cout << str1[len2] << " " << str2[len1] << endl;
```

## Java 코드

```java
String str1 = "abcde"; 
char[] str2 = new char[]{'a','b','c','d','e','f','g'};
int len1 = str1.length() - 2;
int len2 = str2.length - 3;

System.out.println(str1.charAt(len2) + " " + str2[len1]);
```

## JavaScript 코드

```JavaScript
let str1 = "abcde";
let str2 = ['a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 'e', 'f', 'g'];
let len1 = str1.length - 2;
